!Sample_data_processing = The 6 samples were aggregated together into a single processed file using 10X Genomics cellranger aggr version 3.0.2. Default parameters were applied, including --normalize mapped.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38 transcriptome
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: There are two processed file types containing similar information. The tar archive files contain 3 text files each and are embodiments of expression data. These are features.tsv.bz, barcodes.tsv.gz, and matrix.mtx.gz. The features file contains the gene ids (rows), the barcodes file contains the cell ids (columns), and the matrix.mtx file contains a sparse representation of the expression data, in the form of row number, column number, and UMI count, separated by spaces. The other processed file is a molecule_info file.h5 containing compressed molecule information typical of 10X Genomics single cell experiments The h5 processed file and is used for producing the aggregated cell data set (tar file).
